{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0198-house-robber","title":"LeetCode 198 打家劫舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0198-house-robber","wordCount":902,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-198-打家劫舍\">LeetCode 198 打家劫舍</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>你是一个专业的小偷，计划偷窃沿街的房屋。每间房内都藏有一定的现金，影响你偷窃的唯一制约因素就是相邻的房屋装有相互连通的防盗系统，如果两间相邻的房屋在同一晚上被小偷闯入，系统会自动报警。</p>\n<p>给定一个代表每个房屋存放金额的非负整数数组，计算你不触动警报装置的情况下，一夜之内能够偷窃到的最高金额。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 100</li>\n<li>0 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 400</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,2,3,1] 输出：4 解释：偷窃 1 号房屋（金额 = 1），然后偷窃 3 号房屋（金额 = 3），偷窃金额 = 1 + 3 = 4。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [2,7,9,3,1] 输出：12 解释：偷窃 1 号房屋（金额 = 2），偷窃 3 号房屋（金额 = 9），偷窃 5 号房屋（金额 = 1），偷窃金额 = 2 + 9 + 1 = 12。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是线性 DP 的经典模型。对于每间房屋，小偷有两种选择：偷或不偷。如果偷当前房屋，就不能偷前一间；如果不偷当前房屋，最大收益等于前一间的最大收益。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：<code>dp[i]</code> 表示前 i 间房屋能偷到的最高金额。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：<code>dp[i] = max(dp[i-1], dp[i-2] + nums[i])</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[i-1]</code>：不偷第 i 间房屋，收益等于前 i-1 间的最优解</li>\n<li><code>dp[i-2] + nums[i]</code>：偷第 i 间房屋，收益等于前 i-2 间的最优解加上当前房屋金额</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个方程成立的前提是：<strong>当前状态只依赖于前两个状态</strong>。与爬楼梯问题（LC #70）在结构上完全一致，只是爬楼梯求的是&quot;路径数&quot;（加法），打家劫舍求的是&quot;最大金额&quot;（取 max）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力回溯</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每间房屋偷或不偷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DP 数组</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>标准解法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动变量</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>空间优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>滚动变量（最优解）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function rob(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  if (nums.length === 1) return nums[0];&#10;&#10;  let prev2 = 0;&#10;  let prev1 = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    const current = Math.max(prev1, prev2 + num);&#10;    prev2 = prev1;&#10;    prev1 = current;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return prev1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prev1, prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>prev2</code>：对应 <code>dp[i-2]</code>，两间之前的最优解</li>\n<li><code>prev1</code>：对应 <code>dp[i-1]</code>，前一间的最优解</li>\n<li>初始值都为 0（没有房屋时金额为 0）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每次循环面对新的房屋 <code>num</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>prev2 + num</code>：偷当前房屋</li>\n<li><code>prev1</code>：不偷当前房屋</li>\n<li>取两者较大值作为新的 <code>prev1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>只需要两个变量就能完成状态转移，因为当前状态只依赖于前两个状态。</p>\n<p><strong>DP 数组版本（便于理解）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function robArray(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  if (n === 1) return nums[0];&#10;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;  dp[0] = nums[0];&#10;  dp[1] = Math.max(nums[0], nums[1]);&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 2; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i - 1], dp[i - 2] + nums[i]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n - 1];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> robArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模拟执行（nums = [2,7,9,3,1]）：</strong></p>\n<p>滚动变量版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>num=2: current = max(0, 0+2) = 2, prev2=0, prev1=2</li>\n<li>num=7: current = max(2, 0+7) = 7, prev2=2, prev1=7</li>\n<li>num=9: current = max(7, 2+9) = 11, prev2=7, prev1=11</li>\n<li>num=3: current = max(11, 7+3) = 11, prev2=11, prev1=11</li>\n<li>num=1: current = max(11, 11+1) = 12, prev2=11, prev1=12</li>\n<li>返回 12</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常见误区：</strong></p>\n<p>初学者容易认为&quot;偷所有奇数位&quot;或&quot;偷所有偶数位&quot;就是最优解。反例：<code>[2, 1, 1, 2]</code>，最优解是偷第 0 和第 3 间（2 + 2 = 4），不是全部奇数位或偶数位。DP 的优势在于它考虑了所有合法组合的可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>滚动变量</th>\n<th>DP 数组</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>单次遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>滚动变量只需两个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题是线性 DP 的基础模板之一。其&quot;偷或不偷&quot;的决策模型是大量 DP 问题的抽象：LC #213（打家劫舍 II，环形房屋）、LC #337（打家劫舍 III，树形结构）。掌握本题的状态转移方程 <code>dp[i] = max(dp[i-1], dp[i-2] + val[i])</code> 后，可以直接推广到这些变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 198 打家劫舍","id":"leetcode-198-打家劫舍"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 152 乘积最大子数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0152-maximum-product-subarray"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 213 打家劫舍 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0213-house-robber-ii"}}